<!--
    NimPad icon set. Every icon is a Geometry on a 24 x 24 grid (path markup, which WPF parses into a frozen
    StreamGeometry), drawn as a stroke with round caps and joins (Lucide-style outline look). Render them with
    the Icon control, which scales the grid to Size and keeps the stroke at StrokeThickness DIPs:
        <c:Icon Data="{StaticResource Search}" />                     16 px, inherits Foreground
        <c:Icon Data="{StaticResource AppMark}" Filled="True" Size="18" />
    AppMark, AppMarkTile and AppMarkLines are FILLED shapes (Filled="True"); all others are strokes.
    AppMarkImage is the full-color logo (fixed brand blue tile, white lines) for an Image element.
    When adding icons keep the conventions: 24 x 24 grid, absolute path markup, strokes only (no fills).
-->
